  (text "USB: D+ and D- routed as a coupled pair, ESD (U2) next to J1,\nC7 100 nF at U2 VBUS. CC1/CC2 5.1k pull-downs: power from\nC-to-C cables. VBUS capacitance 5.8 uF (C1, C2, C7), under 10 uF."
    (at 25.4 160.02 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid 2bc5edd6-7580-549b-8f06-15bc80331c87)
  )
  (text "Supply: normal-voltage mode. U3 makes 3.3 V; VDD and VDDH tied.\nC2 decouples the module VBUS pin. The firmware sets REGOUT0\nto 3.3 V, so 5 V into VDDH also works on a board built for it.\nSee docs/hardware.md#supply-mode."
    (at 25.4 175.26 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid 6c57c5da-2f5c-527e-b253-f16df192504a)
  )
  (text "Pins follow the firmware (src/main.rs): buttons P0.11/P0.12/P0.24\nto GND (internal pull-ups), I2C P0.26 SDA / P0.27 SCL, P0.18 reset.\nKeep P0.00/P0.01, P0.09/P0.10 free. No bootloader: flash over J2."
    (at 165.1 165.1 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid e65ef957-4842-558d-9c40-bf9c5f37ec6b)
  )
  (text "J3: socket for a 0.96 in SSD1306 I2C module,\n0x3C, 3.3 V. JP1/JP2 as delivered (1-2 bridged):\nGND VCC SCL SDA from pin 1. For a VCC GND\nmodule cut both bridges and close 2-3."
    (at 231.14 93.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid 359e6448-cd92-576d-9892-028c76285996)
  )

